 },
 "block_count": 67,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "b3fe0ec0-de32-4adf-9806-a3eeaedbca5c",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Purpose"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "41193935-ddea-413f-8766-6e82b7113d09",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "حفظ القيود التشغيلية والحَوْكمية الواردة في Trigger المحادثة بتاريخ 2026-09-30 بوصفها قواعد خاصة بمنظومة Accounting Systems — Continuous Knowledge & Classification Operation. هذه الصفحة لا تستبدل المرجع الحاكم؛ بل تسد التفاصيل التي لا تظهر في ملخص الصفحة الحاكمة."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "988f70d4-3c2f-4d98-9f59-a27aef8d2e72",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Trigger Model"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b8ec7378-253e-4423-9b2f-dd3c9d9b2bff",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "كل تشغيل SCHEDULED هو دورة مستقلة:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "01ba17d7-ea0b-4296-97d7-b0f6cf95bfea",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Read State → Determine Next Work → Process → Commit → Verify → Persist → Stop."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "cab0ea54-fc13-42e7-bf27-07e5ffd2a8ef",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا يوجد Live Continuous Process بين الدورات. نهاية الدورة لا تعني نهاية المنظومة. NO_CHANGE لا يوقف التشغيل، وBLOCKED حالة دورة وليست إيقافًا نهائيًا، وPARTIAL تستخدم عندما يُنفذ جزء موثوق ويبقى جزء مفتوح."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ff2a9595-1dd9-4b2f-9dbb-1d0f25aa754a",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Canonical Operation"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "91fa3e4b-2bc0-4bff-b30d-46076df5ac06",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Discovery → Triage → Research → Validation → Classification → Conflict Check → Synthesis → Knowledge Commit → Verify → Quality Control → Gap Detection → Prioritize → Persist State."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "43b55417-c22c-43fb-acd7-0ddda33ba13f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "تحديد العمل التالي يعتمد على الحالة المحفوظة والموثقة فقط، لا على ذاكرة غير موثقة."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "db81c87e-521c-4be1-ad29-d2c03ff725c7",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Entity / Provenance Separation"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a67838a2-450e-4f12-b2dd-b8488888ef3f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "السلسلة المرجعية:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "36261a34-3d5d-478e-8b59-7b1b0c026c18",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Research_ID → Source_ID → Evidence_ID → Claim_ID → Classification_ID / Knowledge_ID → Change_ID → Cycle_ID."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "846f2efb-3fd8-4a5a-aa62-2259b48a8448",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا تُعامل Research / Source / Evidence / Claim / Classification Decision / Knowledge Asset ككيان واحد."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0a6bea88-de5f-4318-9b15-120bff0ed9b8",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "قبل إنشاء Knowledge Asset جديد يجب تنفيذ SEARCH EXISTING KNOWLEDGE ومطابقة الكيان والادعاء والإصدار والسياق."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0ece0a2b-f721-4ff1-905f-50e319d942f8",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Multidimensional Classification"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9656825f-2697-4c7a-a76c-c987e4a3c738",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "يجب فصل الأبعاد التالية وعدم دمجها في فئة واحدة:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6db11d26-3c8b-4346-876d-89dc7f7ce956",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "System Type; Functional Scope; Deployment; Architecture; Licensing; Accounting Standards/Localization; Organizational Structure; Integrations; Reporting/Control; Market/Geography; Product Maturity."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2eb956b-249e-4c4f-a22d-3c751c5d9445",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا يُملأ أي بُعد بلا Evidence. عند غياب الدليل يستخدم UNKNOWN."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "4571a46b-624f-4661-9824-c0d27c1b939e",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "System Identity"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b166f4dc-72df-4665-aeb7-c6c483b966fe",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "الهرمية:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7c3c2af-63ab-466b-b07f-32ae9c52fce0",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Vendor → Product → Edition/Plan → Version → Module/Feature → Localization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6511f69-cd16-4eed-b362-346e5e976cc3",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "أي معلومة تتأثر بالنسخة أو الخطة أو الدولة أو التاريخ تربط بهذه الأبعاد عندما تكون ذات صلة."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a99c3049-0ad0-400a-89ad-0311b0d062a1",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Controlled State Vocabulary"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c953ae54-d672-411d-a8d9-c6b4ba2048b4",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "الحالات المسموحة فقط:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1b3de684-baed-4ad3-8374-e4a8aa094af9",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "DISCOVERED, TRIAGED, RESEARCHING, VALIDATING, SYNTHESIZED, ACTIVE, CONTESTED, CONFLICTED, INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE, DUPLICATE, OUTDATED, SUPERSEDED, REJECTED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "5c74aa35-0a88-43ca-a848-2f25818b07eb",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا انتقال مباشر من DISCOVERED إلى ACTIVE. ولا انتقال من CONFLICTED إلى ACTIVE دون تحقق موثق. ولا انتقال مباشر من SUPERSEDED / REJECTED / DUPLICATE إلى ACTIVE."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "4344f5f9-cb92-4527-a42b-e363a643ed82",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Change / Conflict / Commit Separation"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8ecadd36-c048-4aa6-be52-df9944e0b03a",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Change Type: CREATED, CONFIRMED, UPDATED, CORRECTED, CONTEXTUALIZED, DUPLICATED, SUPERSEDED, REJECTED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c891362f-7f2c-4867-8769-e55cd43d8cec",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Conflict Status: NONE, OPEN, PARTIALLY_RESOLVED, RESOLVED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9550952e-0567-4ef8-a380-9a0bc30d1731",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Commit Status: NOT_ATTEMPTED, PREPARED, COMMITTED, VERIFIED, FAILED, RECONCILING, RETRY_REQUIRED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8a40589d-9d34-4b24-bcdb-d14b62134983",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا يجوز خلط State / Change / Conflict / Commit."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ceb975ce-114e-48ca-867b-1aeaee480d01",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Conflict Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "99a42f07-4393-4be9-aca2-fab8fd658bec",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Detect → Identify Claims → Verify Conflict → Compare Context/Timeframe/Product/Version/Edition/Market/Definitions/Methods/Measurement → Assess Evidence Quality → Seek Independent Evidence → Classify Conflict → Decide → Record Rationale."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0055e309-63e5-4e89-936d-589da97c8ae8",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "أنواع التعارض:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "92a5e65e-1d6d-4051-b2a4-4d024bb2ab4a",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "CONTEXT_CONFLICT, TEMPORAL_CONFLICT, POPULATION_CONFLICT, METHODOLOGICAL_CONFLICT, MEASUREMENT_CONFLICT, INTERPRETIVE_CONFLICT, EMPIRICAL_CONFLICT، ومع الأنظمة المحاسبية:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "57f02793-566e-4e60-b0eb-e68d57948e0d",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "VERSION_CONFLICT, EDITION_CONFLICT, LOCALIZATION_CONFLICT."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1a4f811-ee5c-444c-a2f0-5a87665b7261",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "عند عدم الحسم تبقى الحالة CONTESTED أو CONFLICTED."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "01d73cea-cc70-44e9-b7dc-40ee1b2dbfd9",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Commit / Recovery Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "95632c9f-9c0f-463e-8768-781f6a479d86",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "PREPARE → WRITE → VERIFY."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "21016598-d75b-4058-9a22-5eb1e77d237c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "لا يُعد التغيير نافذًا قبل تحقق الالتزام. عند الفشل:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "56ae131a-7c8a-4f34-85e0-a79bd84540be",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "DO NOT CLAIM SUCCESS → PRESERVE LAST_VERIFIED_STATE → RECORD PENDING_CHANGE → RECONCILE → RETRY SAFELY → VERIFY."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1993fd0-4db6-4908-b30a-6fc7f420d1ad",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "عند UNKNOWN يجب تنفيذ RECONCILE FIRST."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "dbf3032e-2f05-4d9e-a183-2cb9278ffac4",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "يُستخدم Change_ID + Knowledge_ID + Cycle_ID لمنع التكرار. لا تُسجل الدورة كمكتملة قبل الالتزام والتحقق والحفظ."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2f889504-cd1d-4829-a57d-474f98d94c62",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Source Discipline"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "359d9d27-bd6c-4441-9c6e-287fd31c01f0",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "الأولوية للمصادر الأصلية والرسمية، ثم المصادر المستقلة المهنية أو الأكاديمية. يجب الفصل بين Vendor Claim وVerified Fact. لا تُبنى قاعدة تصنيف لمجرد استخدام المورد تسمية تسويقية."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "477f2728-bee2-4b0c-b1e7-1d1ce0967acb",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Priority Logic"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "bcc384db-b861-4238-a6f3-b86811df93af",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "تحديد الأولوية نوعي وفق:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f743aa88-c5b4-4efb-b0d7-175dffbbb651",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Impact × Relevance × Evidence Gap × Novelty × Actionability"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-29T22:19:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "8fdaf0a2-2c8a-48b7-8208-59a0707a9067",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "مع مراعاة Classification Uncertainty."
